  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06). Bus speed: 40 MHz in the ESP-IDF BSP, 80 MHz (library default) in the Arduino examples; recorded 40. Start-up table and starting brightness differ by framework (BSP table ending 0x51 = 0xFF, Arduino class ending 0x51 = 0xD0); both are recorded, the BSP's as initSeq. The glass has rounded corners whose radius Waveshare does not give, so the designer draws them square: keep what matters out of the corners, or set a corner radius on the Display tab once it is measured. On the board and not in this preset: 16 MB of its 32 MB flash: the export builds for 16 MB. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
